; 43f's member zone: served by BIND, named by the catalog, and never mentioned
; in the consumer's configuration. Nothing but the catalog puts it there.
;
; REFRESH is 60 so a missed NOTIFY costs a minute rather than an hour, and
; EXPIRE is short because 43f checks what a withdrawn member does.
$TTL 300
@       IN SOA  ns.member.test. hostmaster.member.test. ( 1 60 60 600 300 )
@       IN NS   ns.member.test.
ns      IN A    10.53.0.7
www     IN A    198.51.100.40
